      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pe_Ell%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Pe Ell houses the Holy Cross Polish National Catholic Church, a historic landmark listed on the National Register in 1987.",
